name: "phighthouse"
displayName: "PHIGHTHOUSE! BRANCH EDITION."
description: '''
[#D75a58[]]Disclaimer: this mod shares the same mod name with the base mod, make sure either one of the mods are disabled first.

[#ffffff[]]PHIGHTHOUSE! is a style i made up which is basically a combination of phighting, a 5v5 fighting game by boggio, and whitehouse, a british extreme music band started by w. bennett.
this mod is a "branch" version of the base mod, meaning it has it's own tech tree, it also comes with a lot of changes from the original mod,
mainly, the coilium & whitehouseium production buildings are totally free, and all buildings from this mod only uses materials from this mod.
(note: this mod was partally inspired by another mod, some buildings from that mod were flipped to fit the phighthouse image, credits to them.)
'''
subtitle: '''
phighthouse whats that?
'''
author: '''
PHIGHTHOUSE!
'''
